# LF everywhere, on every platform. PHPCS (Generic.Files.LineEndings) and Prettier
# both require "\n"; without this, core.autocrlf=true on Windows checks files out
# as CRLF and `composer lint` / `npm run lint:js` fail on untouched files.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files: never normalize or diff as text.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.webp binary
*.ico  binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf  binary
*.mo   binary
*.zip  binary
